get to search the trunk. The previous owner may have left something useful behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find weapons to modify. Add enhanced sights, improve handling with better grips, swap out magazines and more. Craft the weapon that\u2019s right for each situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The denizens of the wasteland are on alert for wayward travellers. Keep out of sight and keep quiet unless you want to be diner. To much noise will bring unwanted attention. Even turning a door handle can alert nearby enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956440/extras/1de68e1cb1309e2105101f5a8d128f14.poster.avif?t=1767012707\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956440/extras/1de68e1cb1309e2105101f5a8d128f14.webm?t=1767012707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956440/extras/1de68e1cb1309e2105101f5a8d128f14.mp4?t=1767012707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Health </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wasteland is a dangerous place. Look after your health with medical supplies, food and water. Rest when you need to, run if you have to and drive when you can.</p>","developers":["Inferno Muse Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956440/header.jpg?t=1767012707","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Mini